  "text": "## Assessment Quiz  \n**You must score 80%+ to pass. Questions cover:**  \n1. AML screening requirements\n2. KYC document validity\n3. GDPR customer rights\n4. Fraud red flags\n5. Reporting obligations\n6. Consequences of violations  \n**Questions (sample):**\n- Q: What should you do if a customer can't provide proof of address? A: Don't open account, escalate to manager\n- Q: Can you tell a customer they matched a sanctions screen? A: No, tipping-off is illegal\n- Q: How long must you keep customer data? A: 6 years after account closure\n- Q: What's the Direct Debit Guarantee? A: Full refund of unauthorized DD within 10 days  \n---",
